- Hourly systemd timer runs "python -m daily_digest feargreed". It fetches both indices, and for each index compares the zone of the NEW reading against the zone of the LAST STORED reading. It sends a Telegram alert only when the new reading entered an extreme zone the previous reading was not in. Staying inside the same extreme zone must stay silent. Leaving and re-entering must alert again. Empty database + extreme value must alert.
